   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **White Cedar** (1 review): Reviewer singles out this version of White Cedar as especially remarkable [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Ripple**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Dark as a Dungeon**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MountainGoats2012-12-14.mix.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 98 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer notes the recording comes from the tour on which the band performed with horns [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MountainGoats2012-12-14.mix.flac16**: taped by anonymous; transferred by BLG; source: [SBD > DAT] + [Schoeps MK4/CMR > Tinybox > Tascam DR-2D] => FLAC [1]. Also: Source combines a soundboard feed via DAT with a Schoeps MK4/CMR microphone recording through a Tinybox into a Tascam DR-2D; Mastering by BLG: Audition for edits, alignment and mixdown; iZotope Ozone 5 for EQ and dynamics; WavePad tracking; xACT tags; FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Visible Vibrations: [The Mountain Goats San Francisco Concert Poster 2012 F-1194 The Fillmore | Visible Vibrations](https://visiblevibrations.com/product/mountain-goats-concert-poster-2012-f-1182-fillmore/) [4]",
